    "scope": "Original Maven packages preserve recursive Java and Kotlin callbacks and owned closures on ordinary-source and reviewed-IR paths. Authors are removed before offline installation into empty caches. Relocated consumers run on java.base alone after installed sources and handoffs are removed. Each source path passes 661 Java and 658 Kotlin recursive checks, 257978 Java and 177270 Kotlin acyclic checks, and 23 Java and 27 Kotlin typed rejections. Each language/path probe passes 824369 assertions with 41857 injected failures, nine reply-owner baselines and 8235 lifetime checks. Malformed native results clear and retire once; deliberate ownership and retirement defects fail at the named check. Exact documentation snippets and all four native-asset tamper cases pass. Mixed packages additionally cover all nineteen primitives and sixteen-argument Unit functions with 66701 Java and 66673 Kotlin assertions. Installed archives remain unchanged.",
